graph TD
    User((User)) <--> |Input/Output| CI[Console Interface]
    CI <--> |User Interactions| MA[Main Application]
    MA <--> |State Updates| GS[(Global State)]
    MA <--> |Chat Data| CS[Chat Session]
    MA <--> |Tool Requests| TA[Tool Agent]
    TA <--> |LLM Queries/Responses| LLM[LLM Providers]
    TA --> |File Operations| FS[(File System)]
    MA <--> |Utility Functions| UF[Utilities]
    
    classDef external fill:#f96,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef core fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:4px;
    classDef support fill:#bbf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef storage fill:#9cf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
    
    class User external;
    class MA,GS core;
    class CI,CS,TA,UF,LLM support;
    class FS storage;

    subgraph Application Boundary
        CI
        MA
        GS
        CS
        TA
        UF
        FS
    end